// A real save rather than an authored one — `extraction` is a mid-run world
// from `dev-saves/`, brought across whole: level, stats, gear and its fusion
// tiers, party, perks and zone. The scenario names only who to fight, which
// is the "what would happen if I hit this right now" question.
//
// A save or template player takes no `equip`, `inventory` or `party`; those
// are `Fresh`-only, and naming one here is an error rather than a no-op.
(
    player: Template("extraction"),
    opponents: [(species: "overseer", count: 1)],
    reps: 20,
    seed: 3,
)
